# CareerForge Windsurf Rules

- Source files live in `src/career_forge/`.
- Test files live in `tests/` and must run cleanly with standard Python unittest or pytest.
- When creating new parsers, inherit from `career_forge.parsers.base.BaseParser`.
- When adding scoring heuristics, ensure weights in `career_forge.core.config.Config` remain normalized to 1.0.
